---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Frequently Asked Questions"
  description="Find answers to common questions about WebUtil. Learn about our privacy-first approach, how our tools work, and more."
>
  <div class="container-main py-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-10">Everything you need to know about WebUtil and our free developer tools.</p>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-container-highest bg-surface-container-low p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-sm">Are the tools really free?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Yes, every tool on WebUtil is completely free to use. There are no hidden charges, no premium tiers, and no usage limits. We plan to keep it this way forever.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-container-highest bg-surface-container-low p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-sm">Do you store my data?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">No. All tools run entirely in your browser using client-side JavaScript. Your data never leaves your device. We do not upload, store, or process any data on our servers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-container-highest bg-surface-container-low p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-sm">Do I need to create an account?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">No account or sign-up is required. All tools are available instantly without any registration.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-container-highest bg-surface-container-low p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-sm">How do I know my data is secure?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">You can verify this by opening your browser's Developer Tools (F12) and checking the Network tab. When you use our tools, you'll see zero network requests being made. All processing happens locally.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-container-highest bg-surface-container-low p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-sm">What browsers are supported?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">All modern browsers including Chrome, Firefox, Safari, and Edge. We recommend using the latest version for the best experience.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-container-highest bg-surface-container-low p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-sm">Can I use these tools offline?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">While the initial page load requires an internet connection, the tools themselves can work offline once the page is loaded since all processing is done client-side.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-container-highest bg-surface-container-low p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-sm">How do you generate revenue?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">We display non-intrusive advertisements via Google AdSense. This allows us to keep all tools free while covering our hosting and development costs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-container-highest bg-surface-container-low p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-sm">Can I request a new tool?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Absolutely! We welcome feature requests. Please <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact us</a> with your suggestion, and we'll consider adding it to our platform.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
